      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p00446",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "女人无意爬起来。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "The woman showed no intention of getting up.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p00446",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "她从低处直勾勾地瞪着顶天大汉似的男人高高在上的眼睛。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "From below, she stared fixedly into the lofty eyes of the towering man.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p00446",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "我无可奈何地蹲了下来，准备将这女人扶起来。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Helplessly, I crouched down, ready to help the woman to her feet.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
